{"sha": "3baa16557a5dd2ba233dd041d6eee315d2e492e07c118231428a5d27acb47502", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "这些范围是在许多化合物上测得的。它们按", "化学键分组，因为化学键的振动主要取决于化学键本身", "及其两个原子，而很少取决于分子的其余部分。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.48\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g11-ftir.jpg}", "", "{\\small 台式红外光谱仪，连同其晶体和夹具。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=0.0036cm, y=0.5cm]", "  % wavenumber axis reversed: x = 4000 - sigma", "  \\fill[black!8] (2500,0.2) rectangle (3500,7.6);", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, align=center, black!60] at (3000,6.8) {指纹区};", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (3600,0) node[right] {$\\sigma$};", "  \\foreach \\s in {4000,3500,3000,2500,2000,1500,1000,500}", "    \\draw ({4000-\\s},0) -- ({4000-\\s},-0.15) node[below, font=\\footnotesize] {\\s};", "  \\node[below=12pt] at (1800,-0.3) {波数（\\si{cm^{-1}}）};", "  \\foreach \\a/\\b/\\y/\\c/\\l in {", "      3600/3600/7/omDef/{\\ce{O-H} free},", "      3300/3400/6/omDef/{\\ce{O-H} bonded},", "      2500/3300/5/omThm/{\\ce{O-H} acid},", "      3300/3500/4/omMeth/{\\ce{N-H}},", "      2850/2960/3/black!60/{\\ce{C-H}},", "      1700/1740/2/omProp/{\\ce{C=O}},", "      1050/1050/1/black!45/{\\ce{C-O}}} {", "    \\fill[\\c, rounded corners=1pt] ({4000-\\b-12},{\\y-0.25}) rectangle ({4000-\\a+12},{\\y+0.25});", "    \\node[anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at ({4000-\\a+40},\\y) {\\l};", "  }", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 主要化学键的吸收位置。\\ce{O-H} 和 \\ce{N-H} 的吸收带位于", "左侧，\\ce{C=O} 吸收带通常最强，位于", "\\qty{1700}{cm^{-1}} 附近；\\qty{1500}{cm^{-1}} 以下为", "指纹区。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[氢键使 O--H 吸收带变宽]\\label{prop:g11:infrared:hbond}", "% ledger: ir:OH-free, ir:OH-bonded, ir:ethanol-OH", "当 \\ce{O-H} 基团以氢键相连时，如液态醇中，", "吸收带较宽，位于较低波数处（约", "3300--\\qty{3400}{cm^{-1}}）；无氢键时（如气态），其吸收带尖锐，", "位于 \\qty{3600}{cm^{-1}} 附近。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在本阶段不加证明地承认：氢键拉动氢原子，使", "\\ce{O-H} 键减弱，其振动变慢；由于每个分子的成键情况略有不同，", "吸收带便展宽成一定范围。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{识别官能团}", "", "", "\\begin{method}[读取红外光谱]\\label{met:g11:infrared:reading}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 先看 \\qty{1500}{cm^{-1}} 以上的区域；将指纹区", "        留待与已知光谱比对。", "  \\item \\qty{1700}{cm^{-1}} 附近：若吸收带很强，则为 \\ce{C=O} 基团", "        （醛、酮、羧酸、酯、酰胺）。", "  \\item 在 2500 与 \\qty{3700}{cm^{-1}} 之间：", "        \\qty{3350}{cm^{-1}} 附近的宽吸收带表示醇中的 \\ce{O-H}；", "        2500 至 \\qty{3300}{cm^{-1}} 的极宽吸收带，若同时含 \\ce{C=O}，则为", "        羧酸；3300--\\qty{3500}{cm^{-1}} 处的中等强度吸收带表示", "        \\ce{N-H}。", "  \\item 结合分子式确定化合物类别，", "        若有 \\ce{C=O} 吸收带，再依其位置核对。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\newcommand{\\irpanel}[2]{%", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.96\\linewidth, height=3.9cm, x dir=reverse, xmin=500,", "    xmax=4000, ymin=0, ymax=105, xtick={4000,3000,2000,1000},", "    /pgf/number format/1000 sep={},", "    ytick={0,50,100}, tick label style={font=\\scriptsize},", "    label style={font=\\scriptsize}, ylabel={$T$ (\\%)}, axis lines*=left,", "    title={\\small #2}, title style={yshift=-4pt}]", "  \\addplot[thick, omDef] table[x=sigma, y=#1] {figdata/out/grade-11-infrared.dat};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}}", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\irpanel{ethanolL}{A：乙醇（液态）}\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\irpanel{ethanolG}{B：乙醇（气态）}\\end{minipage}", "", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\irpanel{propanone}{C：丙酮}\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\irpanel{acid}{D：乙酸}\\end{minipage}", "", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\irpanel{ester}{E：乙酸乙酯}\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\irpanel{amine}{F：乙胺}\\end{minipage}", "", "{\\small 六种化合物的红外光谱，波数单位为 \\si{cm^{-1}}", "（波数向右递减）。本图仅画出本章讨论的吸收带，", "其位置取自实测光谱和数据表，", "形状由简单模型给出。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[读取六种光谱]\\label{ex:g11:infrared:six}", "% ledger: ir:OH-bonded, ir:ethanol-OH, ir:CO-ketone, ir:OH-acid, ir:CO-acid, ir:CO-ester, ir:ethylethanoate-COC, ir:NH", "乙醇（A）在 \\qty{3350}{cm^{-1}} 附近有一个宽的 \\ce{O-H} 吸收带，", "\\ce{C-H} 吸收带略低于 \\qty{3000}{cm^{-1}}，另有一个强的 \\ce{C-O}", "吸收带位于 \\qty{1050}{cm^{-1}} 附近，而 \\qty{1700}{cm^{-1}} 附近无吸收。在", "气态（B）中，其 \\ce{O-H} 吸收带变为一条尖锐谱线，位于", "\\qty{3666}{cm^{-1}}。丙酮（C）无 \\ce{O-H} 吸收带，但有一个很强的", "\\ce{C=O} 吸收带，位于 \\qty{1715}{cm^{-1}}。乙酸（D）两者兼有：一个", "极强的 \\ce{O-H} 吸收带，位于 2500 至 \\qty{3300}{cm^{-1}}，以及一个 \\ce{C=O}", "吸收带，位于 \\qty{1710}{cm^{-1}}。乙酸乙酯（E）的 \\ce{C=O} 吸收带位于", "\\qty{1735}{cm^{-1}}，另有一个强的 \\ce{C-O} 吸收带位于 \\qty{1240}{cm^{-1}} 附近，且", "无 \\ce{O-H}。乙胺（F）在", "\\qty{3300}{cm^{-1}} 以上有两条中等强度的 \\ce{N-H} 吸收带。", "\\end{example}", ""]}